# has both keywords that turn (CR 702.11b, 702.12b) and neither on turn 4 (CR 611.2a, 514.2). Turn 5 the second Plaza
# targets Bot1's own Ragavan, also accepted. Each use is paid by three Moxen and leaves the pool empty.

